WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.754
What does the rep app Home screen show in Field Sales, and how do I use it?

2
00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:12.785
From the bottom bar, tap Home. A greeting card with your name appears, and at the top you see your company logo, the language switch and the sign out button.

3
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:22.661
The Your collection balance card shows the amount you owe to management. Below it, the Route card shows how many of today's customers you have visited. Tap it to open your route.

4
00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:30.794
The Monthly target card shows the targets your manager set for you, how much of each you have achieved, and the amount or quantity still to go.

5
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:38.295
In the Today's stats section you see your net sales for today, what you collected today, and how many invoices and receipts you issued.

6
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:46.441
The Quick actions section has shortcuts to invoices, receipts and customers. Tap Attendance to open the check in and check out screen.
